THE HUMAN · node HUM · HUM · THE HUMAN · techne · the scale that looks · UD0 / techne

universe of origin : the art — a generative rendering of a scale
seal               : Halfway up the ladder, in scale as much as in spirit, is the human — the one rung that looks at all the others. A person is about as many times larger than a cell as a galaxy is larger than a person; we sit, astonishingly, near the geometric middle of everything there is. The art renders that with the oldest geometry of the body: the Vitruvian figure in circle and square.
